				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1733,
				3
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Remove dead IPC and internal modules\n\nEliminate unused submodules from the ApplicationState, IPC, and ProcessManagement layers: dead `PathResolution`, `Recovery`, `Serialization` in Internal; `Message`, `Connection`, `Encryption`, `Security`, `WindAirCommands`, `WindServiceAdapters`, and `Permission` in IPC; plus `WorkspaceContainsGlob` in ProcessManagement.\n\nCondense module documentation to focused summaries, removing migration roadmaps and legacy notes. Preserve only actively-used modules (`ExtensionScanner`, `Persistence`, `TextProcessing`, `Common`, `TauriIPCServer_Old`, `AdvancedFeatures`, `ConfigurationBridge`, `StatusReporter`, `WindAdvancedSync`, `DevLog`, `SkyEmit`, `EmitWithTraceparent`, `UriComponents`, `WindServiceHandlers`, and `NodeResolver`).\n\nThis cleanup reduces noise in the module tree and ensures only live code paths remain in scope.",
			"SHA": "68fa97ee5585b514125db6b618b5c6ea7ec4f243"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-28T17:05:30Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1733,
				5
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Remove dead code and consolidate RPC module documentation\n\nEliminate unused module declarations across the codebase: dead `Hover` and `DefaultConfigurations`/`NLSResolver` modules, legacy `Enhanced` subdirectory, unused `Error` re-export, and 11 dormant RPC scaffolding modules (Types, EchoAction, Commands, Workspace, Configuration, Windows, Terminals, Debug, SCM, Processes, Telemetry) and the deprecated `Vine` submodule.\n\nCondense the `Source/RPC/mod.rs` documentation to a single focused paragraph describing the active `CocoonService` surface. All 80+ lines of dead code and orphaned `pub mod` declarations are removed.\n\nThis cleanup reduces noise in the module tree and ensures only actively-calls paths remain in scope.",
			"SHA": "63dcc59984f7f4356ef400c52867997e543ff63d"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-28T16:29:00Z",
			"File": [
				"⠇⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1733,
				147
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Normalize additional import separations in Vine and MountainVinegRPCService\n\nComplete the absolute-path migration by finalizing import statement cleanup in `Source/Vine/Server/Initialize.rs` and `Source/Vine/Server/MountainVinegRPCService.rs`. Separate `::Vine::Error`, `::Vine::Generated` type imports from local `crate::` bindings, applying the established two-line import pattern consistently.\n\nAlso adjust `Source/IPC/WindServiceHandlers/Git/` handlers to use single-line consolidated imports for local modules in `HandleRevListCount` and `HandleRevParse`, and expand multi-line `uuid::Uuid::new_v4()` calls to block style in `HandleExec` and `HandleRevParse` for improved readability.\n\nThis finalizes the import normalization across all gRPC service handlers, ensuring consistent separation between canonical library imports and local project bindings.",
			"SHA": "54102e9d78d7636097a224b7fecb3540be55f09a"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-05-28T15:14:58Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				1733,
				6
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Remove dead Git::Shared::Generated wrapper and eliminate unused Library re-exports\n\nDelete the `Generated` module from `Source/IPC/WindServiceHandlers/Git/Shared/` which was a thin wrapper around `uuid::Uuid::new_v4()`. Replace all calls to `Generated()` with direct `uuid::Uuid::new_v4().to_string()` in HandleExec, HandleRevListCount, and HandleRevParse.\n\nRemove unused `Air` and `Cache` module re-exports from `Source/Library.rs` and the `Client` module re-export from `Source/Vine/mod.rs`, continuing the absolute-path migration to eliminate local indirection layers.\n\nThis cleanup removes dead code and aligns the Git service handlers with the project's direct-delegation pattern.",
			"SHA": "4e294f6bc5e9e09de72c85d3447306313f1bead1"
		}
